abraflexi-mcp-server (1.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add companion package mcprack-mcp-server-abraflexi: registers
    abraflexi-mcp-server into the local mcprack MCP catalog on install
    (postinst) and unregisters it on removal (prerm), using the new
    'mcprack server create'/'mcprack server delete --yes' CLI commands.

